 R←Test_SendEmail_50(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;connection;parms;rc;msg;log
⍝ A server that closes the connection between two emails: the next `Send` connects and logs on again
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.Clear
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂∆NewParms)
 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 ∆SERVER.DropAll
 ⎕DL 0.2
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf 2=≢∆SERVER.Messages
 →T.PassesIf 2=≢∆SERVER.Logons

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
